I would like a message like 'You feel unsafe' when your HP are low
enough to make it possible that you are killed in the next move by an
ordinary blow of half of the monsters currently standing next to you.
As on low levels you would see this message so often that you'd start
ignoring it, connect it with a level (e.g. level 14 and up) or maybe
even make this the good part of being Envoy of Balance & colleagues. 
It is mainly in the last part of the game that you start ignoring HP
because you feel to strong. 

Also, such a message would make NH a bit more realistic: it is
inprobable that you'd keep hack'n'slashing in a real fight when not much
was left of your body; in NH you don't even notice if you're
absent-minded for a second. "Hey, look, here I was fighting 3 monsters
at a time without noticing that I had no arms or legs left!" 

Eliminate stupid ways to die ! I enjoy the cruel, unavoidable deaths
much more !

